<title>USA: FOB Gulf Grain - Corn basis values slide.</title>
<headline>FOB Gulf Grain - Corn basis values slide.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. FOB Gulf corn basis values were lower Wednesday in reaction to increase amounts of corn entering market channels, grain dealers said.</p>
<p>Soft red winter wheat basis values also eased, pressured by new-crop supplies becoming available from southern Missouri and southern Illinois, dealers said.  </p>
